00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:48,483
If there is a path toward governance tooling, this deck offers it only as a proposal for discussion. First, listen and reconcile IN, LATER and NO, then publish a consent-based charter for review. Next, practice with the community Git ledger, privately verified humans, and equal offchain signalling. Only if the circle chooses execution would human signers use a Safe with public receipts and appropriate review. Binding tools would come only after rehearsal and another explicit choice. Naming Safe, Snapshot X, Aragon, or any other tool is not adopting it. There is no completed governance vote, no deployed DAO contract here, and no hidden instruction to move money. Agents do not gain a vote, a key, or authority at any step. The speed is the speed of informed trust, not the speed of software.
